{"actions":[{"actionCode":null,"actionDate":"2025-04-10","source":"Senate","text":"Received in the Senate.","type":"IntroReferral"},{"actionCode":"H38310","actionDate":"2025-04-10","source":"House floor actions","text":"Motion to reconsider laid on the table Agreed to without objection.","type":"Floor"},{"actionCode":"H37100","actionDate":"2025-04-10","source":"House floor actions","text":"On passage Passed by the Yeas and Nays: 220 - 208 (Roll no. 102). (text: CR H1569-1571)","type":"Floor"},{"actionCode":"8000","actionDate":"2025-04-10","source":"Library of Congress","text":"Passed/agreed to in House: On passage Passed by the Yeas and Nays: 220 - 208 (Roll no. 102).","type":"Floor"},{"actionCode":"H36210","actionDate":"2025-04-10","source":"House floor actions","text":"On motion to recommit Failed by the Yeas and Nays: 211 - 215 (Roll no. 101).","type":"Floor"},{"actionCode":"H30000","actionDate":"2025-04-10","source":"House floor actions","text":"Considered as unfinished business. (consideration: CR H1580-1581)","type":"Floor"},{"actionCode":"H8D000","actionDate":"2025-04-10","source":"House floor actions","text":"POSTPONED PROCEEDINGS - At the conclusion of debate on H.R. 22, the Chair put the question on motion to recommit and by voice vote, announced the noes had prevailed. Ms. Johnson (TX) demanded the yeas and nays and the Chair postponed further proceedings until a time to be announced.","type":"Floor"},{"actionCode":"H8A000","actionDate":"2025-04-10","source":"House floor actions","text":"The previous question on the motion to recommit was ordered pursuant to clause 2(b) of rule XIX.","type":"Floor"},{"actionCode":"H36200","actionDate":"2025-04-10","source":"House floor actions","text":"Ms. Johnson (TX) moved to recommit to the Committee on House Administration. (text: CR H1569)","type":"Floor"},{"actionCode":"H35000","actionDate":"2025-04-10","source":"House floor actions","text":"The previous question was ordered pursuant to the rule.","type":"Floor"},{"